### Third-Party Licenses & eBUS Configuration Files

The Home Assistant integration component (`custom_components/arotherm_genia_ebusd/`) and tests are licensed under the MIT License above.

Files in the `ebusd-configuration/` directory contain message templates and configuration files for the `ebusd` daemon:
- Baseline templates and message definitions derived or adapted from [john30/ebusd-configuration](https://github.com/john30/ebusd-configuration) (including `broadcast.csv`) are licensed under the **GNU General Public License v3.0 (GPL-3.0)**, Copyright (c) John30 and eBUSd contributors.
- Original reverse-engineered message definitions developed specifically for this project (`08.hmux0.csv`, `15.bass3.csv`, `15.basv3.csv`, `76.vwzio.csv`, `04.netx3.csv`, `f6.netx3.csv`) are dual-licensed under both the **MIT License** and **GPL-3.0** to allow seamless upstream contributions to the eBUSd project. Detailed licensing is provided in [`ebusd-configuration/LICENSE.md`](ebusd-configuration/LICENSE.md).

